  "reflectionText": "Isaiah set down the song: in that day you will say, I will give thanks to you, Yahweh. With joy you will draw water out of the wells of salvation. The day he had seen was not yet, but the song was already given. What is it to be given a song to sing for a day that has not yet come, and to keep singing it until the day arrives?",
